- *New on-demand area* `city-hyderabad-raidurg` (Raidurg and Knowledge City, HITEC City; 44 OSM buildings, about 6 KB): exported from `@ibasho/pack-city-hyderabad/engine` as `cityHyderabadRaidurg` (city-pack plugin, registered by the module but its tiles are only fetched on request), `loadRaidurgTiles(read?)`, `RAIDURG_TILE_FILES`, and `CITY_AREAS` keyed by pack id: `{ onDemand: boolean; loadTiles(read?) }` (`city-hyderabad` false, `city-hyderabad-raidurg` true). The area has its own frame (origin 17.4300 N, 78.3795 E). `HERO_CONTEXT_IDS` gains `gb5: ['osm_w1133460476']`, `gb6: ['osm_w1133269186']`.
- *Contract:* `Place.onDemand?: true` (schema too). Do not list or load such places by default; show them when search returns them or the person picks them, then load `CITY_AREAS[place.cityPackId].loadTiles()`.
